{title: Bhaware Ki Gunjan Hai Mera Dil}
{artist: Kishore Kumar Shankar Jaikishan}
{key: D}

{c: Verse 1}
[D] Bhaware ki gunjan hai mera dil,        [D] Kabse sambhale rakha hai dil
Tere li [A] ye, tere li [D] ye,        Tere li [A] ye, tere li [D] ye
[D] Mujhe kabse thi pyaar [G] ki justaju,        Meri Zindagaani mein [D] hai tu hi tu
Mai aa [A] ya hun [G] duniya me [D] tere liye,        [G] Mere dil me hai pya [A] ar ki [D] aarzoo
[D] Gagan se bhee uncha [G] mera pyaar hai,        Tumhi par mitoongaa ye ik [A] raar [D] hai
Tu it [A] na samajh le [G] mere ham [D] safar,        Te [A] re pyaar mein meraa [D] sansaar hai
[D] Bhaware ki gunjan hai mera dil,        [D] Kabse sambhale rakha hai dil
Tere li [A] ye, tere li [D] ye,        Tere li [A] ye, tere li [D] ye
